'''Assault! Naughty Woody''' (強襲！いたずらウッディ, ''Kyōshū！Itazura Uddi'', '''Assault! Naughty Woody''') is an event added in the [[Version 15.3 Update]]. Like all [[Gauntlet]]s, rewards and progress made in  Assault! Naughty Woody will reset when the event ends. The bosses of this Gauntlet are many common enemies that the player encounters during main progress.

==Overview==
===About===
Assault! Naughty Woody contains a total of 20 [[No Continues]] levels. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for each stage completion are Legendary Love Letters.

